<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.42 vs   0.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.82 vs   0.74</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.98 vs   0.71</p>
<p> Sales		   20.48 vs  15.20</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.93 vs   4.97</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.77 vs   9.11</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.49 vs   5.60</p>
<p> Sales		  218.42 vs 156.96</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat processing company is</p>
<p>Sokolowskie Zaklady Miesne SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
